window.products.push({"id":288125,"name":"Kirecoo 3 in 1 Candle Accessories - Candle Wick Trimmer Polished Stainless Steel Wick Cutter, Candle Snuffer, Candle Wick Dipper for Candle Lover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mmo4SmgUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you love to burn candles and always have to find candle scissors to trim the wick, or try not to burn your hair while blowing the candle out, then this is the perfect candle wick trimmer set to have. I can even pull the wick out of the hardened wax if it gets messed up. it perfect for housewarming, xmas, birthday, valentine's day and mother’s day.  You can use the wick trimmer ALL the time, which cuts way down on soot and flickering. It has a wick hook thingy that will help you get the wick straight or whatever if you need to. Also, there's a candle snuffer is more designed for taper candles but you can still use it on pillar candles etc. Just be careful not to lower the dome into the pool of melted wax, cuz it would get coated in wax. You can just hover over the flame if you have a steady hand and it will still snuff out the candle. It just takes a extra couple of seconds.  Note: Please dry candle tools set with a soft cloth after washing, and then store it in order to maintain its durability and aesthetics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mmo4SmgUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kirecoo","source_asin":"B09NBCW9P7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBCW9P7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBCW9P7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":288126,"name":"HENCKELS Fine Edge Pro Knife Block Set, 15-pc, Light Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vYbtuw-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fabricated from durable, high-quality stainless steel, Fine Edge Pro's single-piece, stamped blade construction is lighter than forged knives. Along with the full tang, this encourages maximum maneuverability. Curved for comfort, the traditional triple-rivet handles support fatigue-free cutting. Each time you cook, you'll want to reach for this useful knife set. Henckels International makes essential kitchen tools every home chef needs. From steak knives to spatulas, every product offers high quality at an exceptional value. Created in 1895 by Zwilling J.A. Henckels, this value-driven brand guarantees the same durability, design and ease of use for which the global company is known. Equip your kitchen with expertise with Henckels International.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vYbtuw-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B00H5CY6MO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H5CY6MO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H5CY6MO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
