window.products.push({"id":288131,"name":"Wedding Lanterns, 11\" White Lanterns, Ramadan Lantern Decorative for Wedding Table Outdoor Hanging, Small Lanterns Decorative with Timer, Moroccan Lan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FqTTAK-OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎉【MUTI-USES】: Our decorative lanterns are perfect for wedding centerpieces. They can creat a glowing ambiance for your wedding. They can be used for the aisle of your wedding ceremony, outdoor/indoor table centerpieces, entry decorations, fireplace mantle decor, deck and patio decor or above your kitchen cabinets. 🎄【TIMEING FUNCTION】: Our battery powered lantern with a TIMER gives you the advantage of not having to turn on your decorative lamp/light every night. Just set the timer which is on the bottom of the lantern at the time of day you want it to start and it will turn on the same time every night and run for approx 6 hours. 🎂【HANGING LANTERN】: Circular ring design gives you the ability to hang it from a tree, front porch, patio, gazebo, terrace, branch, tent or outdoor umbrella. Buy more than one to make a beautiful flameless centerpiece at any outdoor wedding reception, party, bridal shower, deck party or birthday party. Perfect for those hot summer nights when sitting out on your deck for candle like flames without the fire. Take to the campsite for a unique way to light up your camper. 🎃【INDOOR/OUTDOOR USE】: Plastic with Metallic white Undertones with led candle and timer function included. Warm white pillar candle sits inside a cool white plastic lantern with glass sides. Both made of weather resistant resin for use indoors or outdoors. 🏮【BATTERY POWER LANTERN】: Each lantern requires 3AAA batteries (NOT INCLUDED). Flame free and smoke free allow you to enjoy the ambiance of candlelight without worry. The dimension of the led candle lantern is 5.7\" x 10\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FqTTAK-OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MammyGol","source_asin":"B0BWXZJQMV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWXZJQMV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWXZJQMV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
