window.products.push({"id":288147,"name":"Travel Kettle, Portable Electric Kettle Small Kettle Boiler for Travel and Work, 304 Stainless Steel,BPA Free, 4 Temperature Adjustable with LED Displ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pW0amFtbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡Smart Temperature Settings - The JOCOSA portable electric kettle has an LED screen that displays the water temperature, and four temperature presets 113°F, 131°F, 175°F, and 212°F. Whether you prefer black tea, green tea, or coffee, this mini kettle has got you covered! With its smart temperature settings, you can quickly and easily make your favorite beverages on the go. （Small kettle can not stew noodles and milk） 💼Lightweight and Portable - Whether you’re camping, traveling, or simply need a compact water kettle for your office, the JOCOSA travel portable kettle is the perfect solution. Weighing only 1 pound and measuring a mere 8.8 inches in height, this small electric kettle is lightweight, compact, and easy to carry around. It’s an ideal choice for hotels that don’t provide clean electric kettles and the perfect travel companion for any tea or coffee lover. ⏰Fast Heating - Do you hate waiting for your water to boil? The JOCOSA mini electric kettle takes just 5-7 minutes to heat up 13 ounces of water. The LED display shows the actual temperature of your water, so you’ll always know when it’s ready. Moreover, this Portable water kettle features automatic shut-off and boil-dry protection, ensuring your safety and peace of mind. （The improved power cord needs to be plugged in slightly harder for the product to work.） 🥛Double-Walled 304 Stainless Steel - Made of food-grade 304 stainless steel, the JOCOSA travel kettle is 100% BPA-free and provides you with healthy, safe water. The double-walled construction of its stainless-steel body ensures that the surface temperature doesn’t become too hot while keeping your water warm for a longer time. Our bottle’s durable construction and quality materials make it an excellent choice for anyone looking for a reliable portable electric kettle. ✋Prevent Burns - The JOCOSA mini electric kettle comes with a vent on the lid that allows for the release of expanding air, preventing hot water from spilling out and causing burns. When heating water, make sure to tighten the lid (and open the top spout) to prevent scalding water from spraying around. And when unplugging the kettle or removing it from its power source, be sure to avoid touching the hot surface, so that you will never have to worry about burns or injuries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pW0amFtbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOCOSA","source_asin":"B0BX9LDHZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX9LDHZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX9LDHZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
