window.products.push({"id":288176,"name":"Loncaster Gifts for Women, Light Up Galaxy Glass Rose Gifts for Her Mom Teen Girl Grandma Best Friend on Christmas, Birthday, Anniversary, Wedding Day","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81162Z4T3XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Gifts for Women: Looking for an ideal gift? When you need to show your love to your mom, daughter, grandma, wife, or best friend, this unique galaxy rose in glass dome is a gift for woman that directly express love and appreciation. It is everlasting and will mean eternal love and show it in a way that words alone can never express. Makes A Smile Happen: This romantic gift can keep the spark of love, whether you are near to her or separated from her cause of the quarantine. Give the woman a surprise with this gorgeous with the enchanted galaxy Led rose light. There is no better feeling than watching her face light up, so why not treat her to the gifts with your sincerity. Christmas Gift for Women: This rose gift is so dazzling at night. The rainbow rose in glass dome is wrapped around bright and cheerful LED lights, which are powered by 3 AAA batteries (Not Included). Just turn on the switch, it will glow warm light through the transparent glass in dark like a nightlight but creates a romantic ambiance. Take it as a Christmas gift for your mom, daughter, grandma, best friend, and even yourself! Exquisite and Packaged Gifts: The women gifts for Christmas is a beautiful sentimental item that your loved ones can keep for ages. It is coming with a designed giftable blue packaging and a greeting card , which saves your time and hassle of finding one. It is also an extraordinary decor that adds style to a wide variety of interiors like livingroom shelf, office, or bedroom. Wonderful Gift Ideas for Any Special Day: A good choice as a gift for women who have everything, when they see their eyes will be full of cheers! Just show Her your love with our rose flower to mother, girlfriend, wife, sister, grandma on Christmas , Birthday,Thanksgiving Day, Valentine's Day, Wedding, Anniversary, Engagement, , Mother's Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81162Z4T3XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Loncaster","source_asin":"B09CDQN12K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CDQN12K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CDQN12K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":288177,"name":"Lush Decor Pink Flutter Butterfly 3-Piece Bedspread Set, Cute Comforter (Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WdiIDE08L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of luxury to your home with our Pink Flutter Butterfly 3-Piece Bedspread Set. The set includes a comforter, a matching pillow sham, and a decorative pillow. Our bedding set allows you to transform any girl's bedroom into a fun and playful escape from the world. Both the quilt and the pillow sham have layers of ruffles in a solid pink color. The layers of ruffles on these pieces also provide some texture to your room. The quilt and pillow sham feature whimsical butterflies on a white background. The pillow sham and the comforter are made from 100% polyester, which is extremely durable and breathable. This material will keep you warm at night while also helping wick away moisture as you sleep. The light pastel colors on our cozy and cute bedding will help you turn any room into one that's fit for a princess.This set is designed for a twin-size bed, but we also offer a full size. The fluffy comforter measures 75\" H x 39\" W with a 30-inch ruffle trim, and the pillow sham measures 20\" L x 26\" W with a 2-inch ruffle trim. The included decorative pillow measures 12\" H x 18\" W. We recommend washing your bedding set in the washing machine on a cold, gentle cycle with similar colors. Tumble dry on low to maintain the look and feel of these luxurious bedding pieces. Iron on low heat as needed, and use only non-chlorine bleach.At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of home accessories, ranging from curtains to bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WdiIDE08L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B08TCCJHD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TCCJHD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TCCJHD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
