window.products.push({"id":288248,"name":"Wax & Wane White Sage + Lavender Modern Candle - 8 Oz Soy Candles Gifts For Women For Home Décor, 40+ Hours Long Lasting Scented Candles Handmade In T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614fJWCBt+S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"YOU’LL BE ABLE TO INSTANTLY UNWIND When life is stressful and you need to decompress, this white sage + lavender candle will become your best friend. With sharp notes of lavender, this candle isn’t a traditional floral but is my favourite way to relax.We find inspiration in natural beauty- long hikes in the woods, the smell of the first snow of winter, the breeze at a rugged coast. Many of our scents are inspired by our travels, experiences, and memories. WHAT MAKES WHITE SAGE + LAVENDER SCENTED CANDLE SPECIAL? ✅ MODERN DESIGN WITH LID -Our jar candles with their minimalist jar design and gold lid are a great addition to any room.✅ STRONG FRAGRANCE -We use premium fragrances and essential oils that are vegan, cruelty free, while still able to fill any room with their strong scents.✅ PERFECT SIZE -A classic 8 oz candle that is perfect size. It can be used in your bathroom, kitchen, living room, or any room in need of a great scent.✅ LONGER BURN TIME -With 40 to 50 hours of burn time our long lasting scented candles also come with lids to protect your candles between burns.✅ MADE IN USA -Each handmade candle is lovingly hand poured in small batches from soy wax derived from 100% American grown soybeans. All candles are hand-poured (with love) in Bend, Oregon. WHY CHOOSE US? Because we believe in creating the very best candles using NATURAL INGREDIENTS and still being ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY With a passion for creating eco-conscious and premium scented candles, every candle is hand-poured and mixed in small batches of just eight to ensure quality and attention to detail. Our scents are carefully curated and always phthalate-free. We believe in using healthy and environmentally friendly ingredients. All of our candles are vegan and fragrances are never tested on animals.CHECK our store for other premium soy candles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614fJWCBt+S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wax & Wane Candles","source_asin":"B086N5XL7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086N5XL7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086N5XL7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
