window.products.push({"id":288431,"name":"Le Creuset of America Signature Enameled Cast Iron Oval Wide Dutch Oven, 3.5-Quart, Palm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oYCjPv7qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prepare a gourmet meal with this le Creuset 3.5 Quart oval wide French oven that blends colorful design with impeccable functionality and versatility. Made from the iconic enameled cast iron, it is formed in two sand models that are used only once then polished, enameled, and fired twice. This unique production process yields a nonreactive cooking surface that can be used on any type of heat source: from the oven, to the grill, to most stove tops and is induction ready. Heat spreads throughout more evenly and is retained for longer, and the enameled surface requires no seasoning. Perfect for locking in flavor and keeping foods moist and tender, the signature enameled cast iron is made with an exterior that resists chipping and cracking. The lightest weight cast iron per quart, this oval wide French oven is designed to enhance the cooking process by evenly distributing heat and locking in the optimal amount of moisture. The possibilities are endless with this versatile oval wide oven; ideal for making fluffy breads and hearty soups, it is a staple in the kitchen. The French oven includes a lid that traps in heat and moisture for more thorough cooking and full-flavored meals. The lid also features a phenolic knob that can withstand temperatures of up to 500 degrees Fahrenheit. With large helper handles, this enameled cast iron piece is perfect for moving from stove to tabletop for easy serving. With quality in mind, the enameled cast iron is backed by a limited lifetime warranty and it is dishwasher safe for an easy clean up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oYCjPv7qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B00Y24I2ZA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y24I2ZA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y24I2ZA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
