window.products.push({"id":288884,"name":"Pigyanting Beauty and The Beasts Rose,Eauty And The Beast Rose in Glass Dome for Real Enchanted Rose Kit Large Ecological Rose Charm Petals Ornament w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-eDfYVklL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"What Is A Beast Rose? A Beast Rose is also called an \"preserved flower\" or \"eternal flower\". It's a natural flower but can be kept for an extended amount of time before withering. Once the flowers start to bloom, They are picked and immersed in a non-toxic, drying compound that draws out the moisture and then dyed with various colors. This unique preservation process gives flowers a long-lasting and sustainable life. The solutions and colorants Are widely used in the food, medical and textile industries, therefore they do not represent any health or environmental risk or hazard. How to maintain(NOTICE): 1.Preserved fresh flower is for indoor decoration, please don't put it outside or in the sun.2.If flower is covered with dust, please use blower(cold light wind) to blow the dust at the distance of 7.5in or so, don't wash it with water.3.Flowers will absorb water a If humid and unventilated, it will get mildewed, ventilate and shine it, it will renew. If your clothing get tainted from flowers, just wash it with soap.4.It Will be dry on dry weather such as fall and winter, it will recover when the weather become humid. And please don't put it near air conditioner or vent.5.Beast rose is not only a flower, but also a Work of art.please don't let your babies or kids eat. Package Included: ?1xPreserved Rose Flower1xLuxury Gift Box1xglass dome Three blue beast roses, representing you is my deepest love in my heart, I hope to remember our beautiful love story forever,also is a symbol of best Wishes.Rose in a glass dome's ideas was inspired by movie\"Beauty and the Beast\",a beautiful true love story.It's a wonderful and unique idea for an anniversary, wedding accessories, birthday gifts, housewarming gifts or just for the Sake of you at cospl Ay, engagement, advice, wedding gifts, wedding decoration, graduation gifts, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, perfect for persons who have difficulties in choosin","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-eDfYVklL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pigyanting","source_asin":"B07MJT7P4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-288884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MJT7P4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MJT7P4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
